{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"一、十有九年。春王正月，諸侯盟于祝阿。晉人執邾婁子。公至自伐齊。取邾婁田自漷水。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"此同圍齊也，何以致伐？未圍齊也。未圍齊則其言圍齊何？抑齊也。曷為抑齊？為其亟伐也。或曰為其驕蹇，使其世子處乎諸侯之上也。取邾婁田自漷水。其言自漷水何？以漷為竟也。何言乎以漷為竟？漷移也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"二、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"三、葬曹成公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"四、夏，衞孫林父帥師伐齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"五、秋七月辛卯，齊侯瑗卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"六、晉士匄帥師侵齊，至穀，聞齊侯卒，乃還。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"還者何？善辭也。何善爾？大其不伐喪也。此受命乎君而伐齊，則何大乎其不伐喪？大夫以君命出，進退在大夫也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"七、八月丙辰，仲孫蔑卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"八、齊殺其大夫高厚。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"九、鄭殺其大夫公子喜。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"十、冬，葬齊靈公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"十一、城西郛。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"十二、叔孫豹會晉士匄于柯。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_168_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_168","textTraditional":"十三、城武城。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}